{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of a boy who goes to meet the twinkling stars and the star that protected the galaxy for countless hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Board a spaceship and explore various planets to seal star fragments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, the planets you'll be playing on are Planet Spring Breeze and Planet Steamy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make apple pies, rescue friends, (run errands), and sell melon bread!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapters 1 and 2 of the  Planet Gray Galaxy arc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an exploration-based adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605\u2606\u2605\u2606</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy Difficulty</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-focused</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the spacebar to explore your surroundings.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore specific objects to gain hints.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Time: Approximately 2 hours</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subsequent chapters available.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up, Down, Left, Right Keys: Movement</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X Button: Menu</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spacebar: Crystal, Investigate, Lift, Pick Up</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950680?t=1766493517","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950680?t=1766493517","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950680/7b1ccbf7